    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57219506f5822de43b8c7a9d4e6b1e3d, type: 3}
    _line: '(I''m going to have to play along. And then, once I have my keys, I can
      leave and go get help. There''s no way I could explain this to 911.)

'
